        <h1>About</h1>
        <p>Chris Krager is the founder and Principal of KRDB, a design, development, and build firm in Austin, Texas, and of ma modular, its modular construction subsidiary. Since forming KRDB in 2002, he has built both firms around two principles: that high-quality modern design should be affordable, and that the best opportunities are the ones you create rather than wait for.</p>
        <p>In recent years, KRDB and ma modular have turned their attention to &ldquo;Missing Middle&rdquo; housing, higher-density types that pair naturally with modular construction and with the firms&rsquo; long-standing focus on incremental development. They are now working with development teams in Austin, Los Angeles, and New York to bring these models to market.</p>
        <p>Krager is a registered Architect in Texas and California. He holds a Master of Architecture from the University of Texas at Austin and a Bachelor of Business Administration from Michigan State University.</p>
        <p><a href="http://www.krdb.com">krdb.com</a></p>
